title: Delete a Taskip Workspace
sidebar:
  order: 6
---
If you no longer need a workspace, you can delete it from the workspace settings. Deleting a workspace permanently removes all associated data, including projects, tasks, clients, and records within that workspace.

### **How to Delete a Workspace**

1. Log in to your Taskip account.
1. Go to Settings from the dashboard.
1. Select Workspace from the settings menu.
1. Locate the workspace you want to remove.
1. Click Delete Workspace.
1. Confirm the deletion when prompted.

![](./delete-your-workspace/content/image-18-1024x492.png)

{% table %}
---
- Important: This action cannot be undone. Make sure to back up any important data before deleting a workspace.
{% /table %}
